`title.lower()` runs before the substitution. The regex then only keeps `a-z`, `0-9` and `-`, so no uppercase letters can come out. A quick run on `'Hello WORLD ÀÉ İstanbul! 123'` returned `hello-world-i-stanbul-123`, which confirms it.

